ready

Rebuild a task's container from the log

A ⟳ button between Run and Settings recreates the workspace container,
rebuilding the image when Containerfile.dev changed: what the agent gets by
ending its turn with 'reload', now within reach of a human who edited the file
themselves. It refuses while the agent is working, notes the rebuild in the log,
and the status banner shows the progress.

Staffa 0.19.0 comes along for its button tooltips, so every icon button says
what it does on hover — the new one telling which file it builds from.
